<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>teamooooo<3</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: #000000;
            flex-direction: column; 
        }

        .hearth {
            margin-top: 200px;
            height: 150px;
            width: 150px;
            background-color: red;
            position: relative;
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            box-shadow: -20px 20px 150px #f20404;
            animation: palpitar 0.5s linear infinite alternate;
        }

        .c {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-45deg); 
            text-align: center;
            z-index: 1; 
            padding: 5px; 
        }

        h1 {
            color: white;
            margin: 0; 
            font-size: 30px; 
            white-space: nowrap; 
        }
h2{
 color: red;
}

        .img {
            margin-top: 200px; 
            max-width: 50%; 
            height: auto; 
            display: block; 
        }

.f{
margin-top:20px;
color:white;
font-size: 24px;
text-align:center;


}

        @keyframes palpitar {
            0% { transform: rotate(45deg) scale(1.10); }
            80% { transform: rotate(45deg) scale(1.0); }
            100% { transform: rotate(45deg) scale(0.8); }
        }

        .hearth::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            height: 150px;
            width: 150px;
            background-color: red;
            right: 50%;
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 20px 20px 150px #f20404;
        }

        .hearth::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            height: 150px;
            width: 150px;
            background-color: red;
            top: -50%;
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 20px 20px 150px #f20404;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="hearth">
        <div class="c">
            <h1>te amo</h1><h2>......</h2>
        </div>
    </div>
    <img class="img" src="gatito.png" >
<div class="f">
        <p>Sabés, nada ni nadie puede borrar lo que siento por ti. Te amo más allá de las dificultades, siempre.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

